    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>48</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></move